{"text": "Figure 1: This is a cute duckling", "context": "Section: Swimming in the lake", "pages": []}
{"text": "Let’s swim!", "context": "Heading, level 1", "pages": []}
{"text": "To get started with swimming, first lay down in a water and try not to drown:", "context": "Section: Let’s swim!", "pages": []}
{"text": "You can relax and look around", "context": "List item; Section: Let’s swim!", "pages": []}
{"text": "Paddle about", "context": "List item; Section: Let’s swim!", "pages": []}
{"text": "Enjoy summer warmth", "context": "List item; Section: Let’s swim!", "pages": []}
{"text": "Also, don’t forget:", "context": "Section: Let’s swim!", "pages": []}
{"text": "1. Wear sunglasses", "context": "List item; Section: Let’s swim!", "pages": []}
{"text": "2. Don’t forget to drink water", "context": "List item; Section: Let’s swim!", "pages": []}
{"text": "3. Use sun cream", "context": "List item; Section: Let’s swim!", "pages": []}
{"text": "Hmm, what else…", "context": "Section: Let’s swim!", "pages": []}
{"text": "Let’s eat", "context": "Heading, level 2; Section: Let’s swim!", "pages": []}
{"text": "After we had a good day of swimming in the lake, it’s important to eat something nice", "context": "Section: Let’s swim! > Let’s eat", "pages": []}
{"text": "I like to eat leaves", "context": "Section: Let’s swim! > Let’s eat", "pages": []}
{"text": "Here are some interesting things a respectful duck could eat:", "context": "Section: Let’s swim! > Let’s eat", "pages": []}
{"text": "<text/>; Food; Calories per portion", "context": "Table row; Section: Let’s swim! > Let’s eat", "pages": []}
{"text": "Leaves; Ash, Elm, Maple; 50", "context": "Table row; Section: Let’s swim! > Let’s eat", "pages": []}
{"text": "Berries; Blueberry, Strawberry, Cranberry; 150", "context": "Table row; Section: Let’s swim! > Let’s eat", "pages": []}
{"text": "Grain; Corn, Buckwheat, Barley; 200", "context": "Table row; Section: Let’s swim! > Let’s eat", "pages": []}
{"text": "And let’s add another list in the end:", "context": "Section: Let’s swim! > Let’s eat", "pages": []}
{"text": "1. Leaves", "context": "List item; Section: Let’s swim! > Let’s eat", "pages": []}
